<title>USA: RDO Equipment unit to acquire Midwest Mack.</title>
<headline>RDO Equipment unit to acquire Midwest Mack.</headline>
<dateline>FARGO, N.D. 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>RDO Equipment Co on Thursday said its wholly owned RDO Mack Sales and Services Inc subsidiary agreed to buy the operating assets and assume related liabilities of Midwest Mack Inc.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Midwest Mack operates a full-service Mack truck center at its dealership location in Fargo, N.D.</p>
<p>Midwest Mack had total revenues of about $5.9 million in 1996.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
